  "citation": "McLaughlin S B; Downing D J; Blasing T J; Jackson B L; Pack D J; Duvick D N; Mann L K; Doyle T W (1995): FORAST Database: Forest Responses to Anthropogenic Stress (FORAST). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/VRC.DB1005",
